<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>纽约时报 实时热点</title><link>https://rss.nytimes.com/services/xml/rss/nyt/HomePage.xml</link><description>纽约时报 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:30:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>官员们向国会工作人员通报有关 Nvidia 事件的情报</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/us/politics/intelligence-nvidia-affair-congressional-briefing.html</link><description>在特朗普总统表示黄仁勋不构成安全威胁后，美国情报机构告诉议员助手，没有证据表明这位丑闻核心女性接受了中国间谍机构的指示。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/us/politics/intelligence-nvidia-affair-congressional-briefing.html'&gt;官员们向国会工作人员通报有关 Nvidia 事件的情报&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Officials Brief Congressional Staff on Intelligence Surrounding Nvidia Affair&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/us/politics/intelligence-nvidia-affair-congressional-briefing.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 03:15:54 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>黄仁勋向 Nvidia 员工道歉并表示正在接受治疗</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/technology/jensen-huang-apology-nvidia-ceo.html</link><description>回到公司一天后，黄先生承认自己违反了英伟达的行为准则，并“犯了一些可怕的错误”。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/technology/jensen-huang-apology-nvidia-ceo.html'&gt;黄仁勋向 Nvidia 员工道歉并表示正在接受治疗&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Jensen Huang Apologizes to Nvidia Employees, Says He Is in Therapy&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/technology/jensen-huang-apology-nvidia-ceo.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:46:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着人工智能的出现，股票抛售将继续球员再次倒下</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/stocks-sp500-nvidia-ai.html</link><description>由于投资者还担心关税和利率，英伟达、Anthropic 和其他科技公司的股价在盘前交易中暴跌，延续前一交易日的跌势。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/stocks-sp500-nvidia-ai.html'&gt;随着人工智能的出现，股票抛售将继续球员再次倒下&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stock Sell-Off Set to Continue as A.I. Players Fall Again&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/stocks-sp500-nvidia-ai.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:36:06 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>特朗普政府以不公平做法为由对数十个国家征收新关税</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/trump-tariffs-trade.html</link><description>最近的事态升级之际，政府面临着持续的法律障碍和即将上任的民主党领导的国会的新审查。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/trump-tariffs-trade.html'&gt;特朗普政府以不公平做法为由对数十个国家征收新关税&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Trump Administration Unveils New Tariffs for Dozens of Countries, Citing Unfair Practices&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/business/trump-tariffs-trade.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 13:24:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>爱荷华州即将发生爆炸。居民对此无能为力。</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/us/iowa-ammunition-plant-lead-explosion-middletown.html</link><description>米德尔敦毗邻一处陆军设施，周三将在那里引爆危险化学品，居民们正在用胶带封住门，准备逃离。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/us/iowa-ammunition-plant-lead-explosion-middletown.html'&gt;爱荷华州即将发生爆炸。居民对此无能为力。&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：An Explosion Is Coming to Iowa. And Residents Can’t Do a Thing About It.&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/us/iowa-ammunition-plant-lead-explosion-middletown.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 02:06:53 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>